WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
 Who told you you could fish here?

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
 I thought it was state property.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
 State.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.000
 Yeah.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
 Yeah.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.000
 Yeah.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
 State.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
 Hit the road, dude.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
 This ain't no state property.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.000
 This is private property.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000
 Oh, okay.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.000
 What's your name in here?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.000
 I want your name.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
 I can call down and see who gave you permission.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.000
 My name.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.000
 State property.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.000
 My name Hubert.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.000
 Last name.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.000
 Jones.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.000
 Hubert Jones.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.000
 Yeah.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.000
 State property.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000
 I ain't never heard of that before in my life.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.840
 - Yeah.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.420
 (upbeat music)

